1. Dataset Description:

The Penguins dataset contains biophysical measurements of three penguin species (Adelie, Chinstrap, Gentoo) from the Palmer Archipelago in Antarctica. Features include bill length, bill depth, flipper length, and body mass, along with the species identification.

2. Data Cleaning:

